    "en": {
      "trackName": "Olsen - Crazy Eights Card Game",
      "description": "I made this version of Olsen to be a relaxing card game you can play whenever you want to pass the time: quick to start, easy to read, and easy to return to when you want one more round.\n\nOlsen is a Norwegian card game in the Crazy Eights family. Match suit or rank, play an 8 to choose a new suit, and be first to empty your hand. When you are down to one card, you say Olsen. The rules are simple, so you can just chill and play without thinking too hard.\n\nPlay against one, two, or three AI opponents with names, different difficulty levels, and a bit of personality. You can also choose the look you like best with kids, adult, and senior themes.\n\nWHAT YOU GET\n• Short rounds that fit a commute, a break, or a quiet evening\n• One-handed play on iPhone\n• Built-in tutorial and a clear rules screen\n• Works on iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch\n• 20 Game Center achievements\n• No internet needed\n\nNo sign-up. No waiting for other players. Just Olsen when you feel like a calm round of cards.",
